><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience needs to be picked up in this mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 30 minutes. <i>&quot;OHHHH REAL ORIGINAL MISTER DESIGNER!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522160/extras/5b59e0377c9d849f022fa286d3438e67.avif?t=1752290533\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple layers of meta progression to help you on your runs, and keeping you coming back for more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gem currency (awarded by playing) to upgrade 40+ skills to all your characters permanently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you kill with an ability, weapon and character, the more experience they'll get. Each having 50 levels, permanently making them stronger!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522160/extras/1852c1cd97c9a6f45e80936fc0340116.avif?t=1752290533\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in leaderboards specific to level, amount of players, and game mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard, Time Attack, and Survivor modes leaderboards' are reset with every major update.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily leaderboards reset every 24 hours, and top scores are posted and immortalized in the Letter Lancers discord.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: An active internet connection is required to post your leaderboard scores. (You can still play without an internet connection)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522160/extras/fe3e500d7a432e2327f29495b38711b0.avif?t=1752290533\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create different builds from hundreds of modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ weapons and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ meta progression upgrades to help you on your runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels for every ability, weapon, and character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different game modes, 1 of which offers players a <strong>different experience every single day</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
